    "mechanism_of_action": {
      "value": "12.1 Mechanism of Action Guselkumab is a human monoclonal IgG1\u03bb antibody that selectively binds to the p19 subunit of interleukin 23 (IL-23) and inhibits its interaction with the IL-23 receptor. IL-23 is a naturally occurring cytokine that is involved in normal inflammatory and immune responses. Guselkumab inhibits the release of proinflammatory cytokines and chemokines.",
      "source_type": "openfda_label",
